<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">Organizations that partner with
the American Red Cross enjoy:</span><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0.25in; text-indent: -0.25in;"></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);">Visibility
for actively engaging with a trusted community partner</span></li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);">The
knowledge that they are helping save lives</span></li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);">Employee
and group engagement</span></li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);">Improved
customer or member perceptions and loyalty &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);">New
leadership opportunities</span></li></ul></span><!--[if !supportLists]--><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p>









<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">You’ll also support a wide range of
community services – from disaster relief to fire prevention, to water safety,
first aid, CPR training, service to the Armed Forces and much more. Because, by
supporting one Red Cross service, you support them all.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0.25in 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">At the Red Cross, we are proud to be a dominant force that
supports local communities and communities across our great nation. Energize
your people and your mission by joining the Red Cross Blood Program.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
